{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number and the negative of one of the solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9f8675f0b936cc7f8cff88afcdfc5a7fbc77295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-3x+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" /> is a solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d1866fb97ca9cca51bf651ddb1169be17c91e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+3x-c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />, then the solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9f8675f0b936cc7f8cff88afcdfc5a7fbc77295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-3x+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" /> are\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/9/f29380ce7081a94e6a1f2682fbeeb85de861aea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1,~2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }-1,~-2\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }0,~3\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }0,~-3\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\frac{3}{2},~\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"540\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>We let the roots of the first equation be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/4/ba43a2427cd2b08e68760b577866e113c17c7966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"11\" /> and the roots of the second equation be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf17d1a69dab89ee146742301129457dd6095e66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s, -t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" />. By Vieta's Formulas, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f6919e3dbe5ea2d3bddac06fe694fda873b9975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/3/e0302924816b2eb3048cc0e2e311ab4c6b402612.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s-t=-3$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bc0da2a461f41cd9906e19195b03a8fe2491cc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs=c$\" width=\"49\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/6070b71e037852da1c8ae456f45531aeccbc7908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-st=c$\" width=\"61\" height=\"11\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6adb265cc9fc5b1bf5c0f52b670cc351e732e0df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=t$\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a82a110370340d8bd55b48d79bbfe7bdfcf87d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t+s=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b917de4a1133bb33bbb0bfcdcf6dd2e7b0610a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s-t=3$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a607fd61885c014512c949fee18869690330407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=0$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53477f8e23b5883d96bfaab10149e9254dc5529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=3\\Rightarrow \\textbf{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />.~MathJams\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME\" title=\"1977 AHSME\">1977 AHSME</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1976 AHSME Proble